    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοχ-αστέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must aim at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μέσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1266b28
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must make a point of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μή . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					16.143
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must form a conjecture</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.15.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
